+## Budget Caps
+
+The Token Budget Modal (`AiBudgetModal.tsx`) provides granular control over organizational spending across each configured AI provider.
+
+![Token Budget Modal - Unlimited Quota](images/slice2-ai-budget-modal-unlimited.png)
