+### Token Cap Policies:
+- **Enforced Cap** (`cap-mode-enforce-btn`): Administrators define a monthly token quota (e.g. 1,000,000, 5,000,000, 25,000,000, or 100,000,000 tokens via quick presets). Once `tokens_used >= token_cap`, subsequent reservations fail closed with `BudgetExceeded`, and Sparkle FIM completions return status `budget`.
+- **Hard AI Freeze** (`preset-budget-0-freeze-btn`): Setting `token_cap = 0` immediately halts all model queries and agent transition checks for that provider. It serves as an instant financial circuit breaker.
+- **Unlimited Quota** (`cap-mode-unlimited-btn`): Sets the internal ceiling to `10_000_000_000` tokens, tracking ledger consumption without automated cutoffs.
