+4. The assistant fetches `https://kanban.example.com/llms.txt` and discovers skills (`kanban-workflow-setup`, `kanban-ticket`, `kanban-agent-manager`, `reality-checker`).
+5. Complete the interactive interview. The assistant configures local instructions in `.agents/skills/` and persists user preferences via `PATCH /api/v1/users/me/preferences` (`agent_onboarding_prefs`).
